   "metadata": {
    "title": "WHO estimates 14.9 million excess deaths",
    "description": "WHO **estimates** that about **14.9 million** excess deaths (range 13.3 to 16.6 million) were associated with the pandemic in 2020 and 2021, nearly three times the 5.4 million COVID-19 deaths reported for those years. It is an estimate, not a count.",
    "tags": [
     "who",
     "milestone"
    ],
